OL,3,GNEWSAPair who laundered #17m tried to
OL,4,Aflee UK on flight
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo people who have been jailed after
OL,7,Flaundering more than #17m in cash tried
OL,8,Fto flee the UK on the flight to
OL,9,FBeijing.
OL,11,FKexie Liu, 31, and Jiarun Li, 26, were
OL,12,Farrested while on bail as they tried to
OL,13,Fget on the plane at Heathrow, West
OL,14,FMidlands Police said.
OL,16,FThe pair, of Bromsgrove Street,
OL,17,FBirmingham, had earlier been detained
OL,18,Fin September last year on suspicion of
OL,19,Fmoney laundering, after #49,000 in cash
OL,20,Fwas recovered from a vehicle.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
